  description: "Each time a monster(s) is Special Summoned that is a \"Yubel\" monster
    or mentions \"Yubel\", place 1 Chronicle Counter on this card. You can remove
    Chronicle Counters from your field to activate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF
    1: Special Summon 1 \"Yubel\" from your GY.\r\n\u25CF 2: Add 1 of your banished
    cards to your hand.\r\n\u25CF 3: Banish 1 card from your Deck.\r\n\u25CF 4: Destroy
    1 card on the field.\r\n\u25CF 5: Add 1 \"Super Polymerization\" from your Deck
    to your hand.\r\nYou can only use this effect of \"Mature Chronicle\" once per
    turn."
